            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "eka mbere no kuguha umugisha nzowuguha, kandi no kugwiza nzogwiza uruvyaro rwawe, rungane n’inyenyeri zo kw ijuru, canke n’umusenyi wo mw isēsero ry’ikiyaga; kandi ruzokwegukira amarembo y’abansi barwo; ",
          "type": "text",
